  "notes": [
    "Flowchart-style plan ('A Study Plan for the B.Sc. Degree in Mathematics', Department of Mathematics, College of Sciences). The PDF prints no credit hours at all (neither per course nor per semester or in total), so every 'credits' value and total_credit_hours are null.",
    "Semesters are labelled 1st-8th; the PDF does not name them fall/spring, so 'semester' is null, 'term' holds the printed semester number and 'year' is derived (terms 1-2 = year 1, ... 7-8 = year 4).",
    "Prerequisites are drawn only as coloured arrows between boxes and are not stated as text, so they are null.",
    "Arabic Language is printed with two codes '0201102 - 0201105' (0201105 is Arabic for non-Arab speakers in other plans). Placeholder codes (1411xxx, 1440xxx, xxxxxxx) are kept as printed.",
    "Elective slots: 'Dept. Support Elect.' (1411xxx), 'Univ Elec' (xxxxxxx) and 'Dept. Core Elect.' (1440xxx) are typed elective."
